{
  "name": "Shield Striker Style II",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Acquired with CR11 or higher. This skill only produces an effect when you are equipped with a [Shield]. The damage you take from &laquo;Protect&raquo; and &laquo;Take Over&raquo; is reduced by [SRx8].</p>\n<p>(SR2): Increase your [Attack Power] by +[STR mod].<br>(SR3): One shield you are equipped with increases its [Physical Defense] by +[INT mod].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A fighting style that skillfully combines weapon and shield techniques and applies them to attacks. Its defensiveness shows its true value when protecting allies.</p>",
